{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/032dfe7b7b127fe3b2f8de588647d058.poster.avif?t=1768288516\" width=798 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/032dfe7b7b127fe3b2f8de588647d058.webm?t=1768288516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/032dfe7b7b127fe3b2f8de588647d058.mp4?t=1768288516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid \u2013 Music - Rhythm</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To the Grid-M</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, Hold, Slide and Swipe to the Rhythm in this unique grid bound rhythmic experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High variety music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide songs both original and licensed from indies, and upcoming artists to more established rhythm game composers. Play hand crafted levels and boss battles with music from hip hop to electronic music passing by trance. There's something for everyone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For all skill levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For beginners the easy difficulty is as accessible as it gets. 9 Squares, click the note with right timing. Slow songs, simple patterns, everything to get a grasp of the basics. And if its still too hard, there are modifiers to lessen the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experts at rhythm games know no bounds and neither does Grid-M. Take on up to 25 squares, on a moving and rotating grid with high BPM songs and complex patterns. And if it\u2019s not enough, there are Modifiers to further increase the difficulty or just go wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/eba9199ae849724561c1d0a5dbbab7a9.poster.avif?t=1768288516\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/eba9199ae849724561c1d0a5dbbab7a9.webm?t=1768288516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/extras/eba9199ae849724561c1d0a5dbbab7a9.mp4?t=1768288516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The fair progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get compared to people of your skill level and feel your progression. Grid-M Abstracts away positions until they are pertinent (top 10). Instead you progress through the score distribution rank tiers. There\u2019s always a small goal within reach! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your scorecards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The score is everything in Rhythm game and now it is also a card. Have your highscores turn into cards that you can save and share!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2327270?t=1768288516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/eccd901555f1c2d226af7cf991c4be32ecbf74d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768288516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/45ae9dbf6b643a16c669fef960ab19c10d5e0cf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768288516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270/45ae9dbf6b643a16c669fef960ab19c10d5e0cf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768288516","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327270